===Interjection===
{{head|ru|interjection}}

# {{lb|ru|vulgar|swear word}} ''interjection'' (may be contracted to {{m|ru|бля}}); compare [[for fuck's sake]]!, [[shit]]!, etc.
#: {{syn|ru|блин<q:euphemism>}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[ты|Ты]] [[что]] [[делать|де́лаешь]], '''блядь'''?!|What are you doing, '''for fuck's sake'''?! / What '''the fuck''' are you doing?!}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar}} used as filler or intensifier
#: {{ux|ru|Я знаю, '''блядь'''.|I '''fucking''' know that.}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|intensive}} (may be contracted to {{m|ru|бля}}); compare [[damn]], [[fucking]], etc.
#: {{uxi|ru|'''[[бля]]''' [[быть|бу́ду]]|I’ll be '''a whore''' (used as an affirmation; translates to "I understand what you expect of me and I take full responsibility for what I said, and I swear that what I said is the truth".)}}
#: {{ux|ru|'''[[бля|Бля]]''' [[быть|бу́ду]], [[не]] [[брать|брал]] [[я]] [[твой|твои́]] [[штаны́]]!|I'm telling you, I didn't take your '''fuckin'''' pants!}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar}} {{w|discourse particle}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]], '''[[бля]]''', [[три]] [[день|дня]] [[не]] пил!|I haven't had a drink in three '''fuckin'''' days!}}

